uts an Exasol database on this computer and sets it up for the work you do. What it sets up depends on your **persona**. Pick a section below, or in the list at the top of the sidebar."},"5":{"id":"/-3","page_id":"/","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/#from-a-notebook","content":"`nb.docs()` opens the section of the persona whose notebook you are in."},"6":{"id":"/data-scientist","page_id":"/data-scientist","type":"page","content":"The data science workflow","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Data Scientist"],"tags":[],"url":"/data-scientist"},"7":{"id":"/data-scientist-0","page_id":"/data-scientist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/data-scientist","content":"The end-to-end workflow most data scientists follow, in eight stages, and how the Starter Kit supports each one."},"8":{"id":"/data-scientist-1","page_id":"/data-scientist","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/data-scientist#how-the-kit-fits-in","content":"How the kit fits in"},"9":{"id":"/data-scientist-2","page_id":"/data-scientist","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/data-scientist#two-ways-through-each-notebook","content":"Two ways through each notebook"},"10":{"id":"/data-scientist-3","page_id":"/data-scientist","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/data-scientist#developers","content":"Developers"},"11":{"id":"/data-scientist-4","page_id":"/data-scientist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/data-scientist","content":"Most data science work is not a straight line. You set up, load the data, look at it, prepare it, model it and check the result. Then a finding in a later stage sends you back. A column you trusted turns out to give away the answer, so you prepare the data again. Treat the eight stages as a loop, not a checklist."},"12":{"id":"/data-scientist-5","page_id":"/data-scientist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/data-scientist","content":"Choose a stage to read its page. Each page says what the stage is for, where you do it in the kit, a worked example on the kit's sample data, and what can go wrong."},"13":{"id":"/