ds the slots. With nothing to change, the saved approval stands."},"1092":{"id":"/data-scientist/explore/approve-the-column-map-41","page_id":"/data-scientist/explore/approve-the-column-map","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/data-scientist/explore/approve-the-column-map#worked-example-amazon_sales","content":"On a table directly, with no review:"},"1093":{"id":"/data-scientist/explore/approve-the-column-map-42","page_id":"/data-scientist/explore/approve-the-column-map","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/data-scientist/explore/approve-the-column-map#worked-example-amazon_sales","content":"After the approval, the cell that follows it runs the leakage check. The printed line for a column that gives the answer away has this form:"},"1094":{"id":"/data-scientist/explore/approve-the-column-map-43","page_id":"/data-scientist/explore/approve-the-column-map","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/data-scientist/explore/approve-the-column-map#worked-example-amazon_sales","content":"The text in the quotes depends on the data, so the cell prints the value it found."},"1095":{"id":"/data-scientist/explore/approve-the-column-map-44","page_id":"/data-scientist/explore/approve-the-column-map","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/data-scientist/explore/approve-the-column-map#versions","content":"Every approval is a new version. Nothing is overwritten."},"1096":{"id":"/data-scientist/explore/approve-the-column-map-45","page_id":"/data-scientist/explore/approve-the-column-map","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/data-scientist/explore/approve-the-column-map#versions","content":"Approving an older version's roles again brings it back as the newest version. In the card, **Version history** lists each version with what changed, and **Restore** saves an older version's choices as a new one."},"1097":{"id":"/data-scientist/explore/approve-the-column-map-46","page_id":"/data-scientist/explore/approve-the-column-map","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/data-scientist/explore/approve-the-column-map#versions","content