to 128,969, the same as `SELECT COUNT(*)` on the view."},"1338":{"id":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views-43","page_id":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views#measured-on-a-real-database","content":"**Counting by category.** Grouping by `category` gives the top rows:"},"1339":{"id":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views-44","page_id":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views#measured-on-a-real-database","content":"`category`"},"1340":{"id":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views-45","page_id":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views#measured-on-a-real-database","content":"`amazon_order_lines_count`"},"1341":{"id":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views-46","page_id":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views#measured-on-a-real-database","content":"`total_amount`"},"1342":{"id":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views-47","page_id":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views#measured-on-a-real-database","content":"Set"},"1343":{"id":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views-48","page_id":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views#measured-on-a-real-database","content":"50,281"},"1344":{"id":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views-49","page_id":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views#measured-on-a-real-database","content":"39,202,022.03"},"1345":{"id":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views-50","page_id":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/data-scientist/explore/semantic-views#measured-on-a-real-database","content":"kurta"},"1346":{"id":"/data-scientist/