 An empty file cannot be loaded."],[2507,"Check the kit"],[2533,"Check the kit"],[2057,"Check the result of the new roles"],[1607,"Check the schema name and its case."],[1603,"Check the user, then enter the password again in the hidden box."],[2770,"Check this machine's requirements; install nothing."],[2013,"Check whether tracing is on:"],[3018,"Check, set up, stop"],[2855,"Checks"],[3095,"checks that every column has a role, that none sits in two slots, and that the table has not changed since it was profiled"],[2392,"Choose a Gemini model ID that your key can call. Google's OpenAI compatibility page explains how the endpoint is used."],[2371,"Choose a model ID from the models overview. Copy it exactly, for example `claude-opus-5-5`."],[1875,"Choose a model yourself"],[12,"Choose a stage to read its page. Each page says what the stage is for, where you do it in the kit, a worked example on the kit's sample data, and what can go wrong."],[43,"Choose and change a persona"],[2815,"Choose and change a persona"],[2564,"Choose the Data Scientist set"],[2305,"Choose the model and its effort"],[1478,"Choose where your data comes from, load it, connect an external source, and read every table in the data map."],[2298,"Claude (Anthropic)"],[2356,"Click **Check and list the models**. The kit sends one request to the provider with the key and lists the chat models the key may use. A refused key says so here."],[1361,"Click **Preview**. Read the dimensions and metrics of each view, what the AI proposed, and what was refused and why. Nothing is written yet."],[1362,"Click **Publish the model**."],[2359,"Click **Use this model**. The row then reads *Using your-model · effort high*."],[1066,"Column"],[1551,"Column"],[1557,"Column map"],[47,"Column maps"],[3076,"Column maps"],[3206,"Column maps"],[1420,"Column maps and their versions, in `descriptors/`."],[1630,"Column names become plain upper-case SQL names. Other characters become `_`. A name that starts with a digit gets a `C_`